  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that,<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />i.e. <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math> is divisible by <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Clearly,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> bracket is divisible by <math><mn>50</mn></math> and the last one is divisible by <math><mn>30</mn><mo>.</mo></math> So, both are divisible by <math><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>270</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>270</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Hence, the remainder obtained is <math><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo></math>",
